/**
 * KPI tiles of "The Great Puerto Rico Dashboard" prototype, as declarative
 * configuration (server-only — the copy carries economic figures, so it is
 * served exclusively through the authenticated /api/economy/fixed-snapshot
 * route, never bundled into page JS).
 *
 * Each tile is resolved on the client against the fixed snapshot
 * (snapshot.json) or, when lib/economy/board/liveMap.js maps its id to a live
 * indicator with usable data, against the live data layer.
 *
 * Value specs:   { s: seriesId, fmt }            last non-null observation
 *                { f: factId, key?, mul?, fmt, suffix? }
 *                { num, fmt, suffix? }            literal number
 * Delta x specs: { yoy: seriesId, lag }           signed % change vs. lag
 *                { ago: seriesId, lag, fmt }      value `lag` periods back
 *                { f: factId, key?, as }          as: "sg" (signed %) or fmt
 * `k` (period key of the freshness stamp): literal or { last: seriesId }.
 */

